# Design system (always on)

**Source of truth:** `src/index.css` (`:root` + `.theme-light` overrides).  
**Reference only:** `app-starter/globals.css` (kit sample — do not replace `index.css` with it).

Never invent or hardcode colors, radii, or motion curves. Use CSS variables from `src/index.css`.

## Token map (use these names in this project)

| Kit / generic | This project |
|---------------|--------------|
| `--text` / body text | `var(--txt-hi)` |
| muted text | `var(--txt-mid)`, `var(--txt-lo)` |
| borders | `var(--hair)`, `var(--hair-strong)` |
| glass surfaces | `var(--glass)`, `var(--glass-hi)` |
| brand gradient | `var(--grad-red)`, `var(--grad-coral)` |
| primary red | `var(--red)` |
| accent colors | `var(--orange)`, `var(--green)`, `var(--violet)`, `var(--blue)` |
| card radius | `var(--r-lg)`, `var(--r-md)`, `var(--r-sm)` |
| motion | `var(--ease)`, `var(--spring)` |

## Surfaces
- Background: `var(--bg)`; cards/panels: `var(--surface-1)` → `var(--surface-3)`.
- Client shell: `.workout-shell` (dark) or `.theme-light` (light mode on client).
- Light mode: parent has `.theme-light` — tokens auto-switch; test both themes.

## Typography
- **Display / hero / tile titles:** `.font-saira` (Saira Condensed italic 800) — see home dashboard.
- **Stats / numbers:** `.font-display` + `.tnum` (Space Grotesk, tabular-nums).
- **Body / UI:** Inter (default).

## Gradients (restrained)
- `--grad-red` / `--grad-coral`: primary CTAs, hero, active accents only — not large backgrounds except the home hero pattern.
- Per-area tile accents: red (workout), orange (cardio), green (nutrition), violet (supplements), blue (progress) — see `ModernClientInterface.tsx` home grid.

## Elevation
- Prefer `var(--hair)` borders + soft colored shadows (`.shadow-red`, `.shadow-soft`) over heavy black drop shadows.
- Home patterns: `.home-tile`, `.home-hero`, `.home-qstat` in `index.css`.

## Do / Don't
- DO match existing screens (home dashboard, workout page) before inventing new patterns.
- DO keep 44–48px minimum touch targets.
- DON'T replace `src/index.css` or merge `app-starter/globals.css` without explicit user approval.
- DON'T redesign coach + client + all tabs in one pass.
